Objectives: 
  1.To design and simulate an interactive 7-segment display interface with push-button control using an Arduino Uno in Proteus.
  2.To implement direct port manipulation (PORTD) in C/C++ for efficient, simultaneous multi-pin digital output toggling.
  3.To execute a dynamic sequence counter that cycles numbers 0 through 9 on the 7-segment display upon push-button state detection.
